          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x+3x-5&=11\\\\4x-5&=11\\\\4x&=16\\\\x&=4\\end{align*}$$\nCheck:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{LHS}&=4+3\\times4-5\\\\\\text{LHS}&=11\\\\\\text{RHS}&=11\\end{align*}$$\nLHS = RHS.",
