        "answer": {
          "short": "$a=-1$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3(a+4)&=9\\\\a+4&=3\\\\a&=-1\\end{align*}$$\nCheck:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{LHS}&=3(-1+4)\\\\\\text{LHS}&=9\\\\\\text{RHS}&=9\\end{align*}$$\nLHS = RHS.",
