          "short": "$x=-1$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2x+6&=3-x\\\\3x+6&=3\\\\3x&=-3\\\\x&=-1\\end{align*}$$\nCheck:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{LHS}&=2\\times(-1)+6\\\\\\text{LHS}&=4\\\\\\text{RHS}&=3-(-1)\\\\\\text{RHS}&=4\\end{align*}$$\nLHS = RHS.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
