        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=7\\frac{1}{3}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x+2&=4(x-5)\\\\x+2&=4x-20\\\\2&=3x-20\\\\22&=3x\\\\x&=\\frac{22}{3}\\\\x&=7\\frac{1}{3}\\end{align*}$$\nCheck:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{LHS}&=\\frac{22}{3}+2\\\\\\text{LHS}&=\\frac{28}{3}\\\\\\text{RHS}&=4\\left(\\frac{22}{3}-5\\right)\\\\\\text{RHS}&=4\\times\\frac{7}{3}\\\\\\text{RHS}&=\\frac{28}{3}\\end{align*}$$\nLHS = RHS.",
